  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Let's recap the full journey.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2000,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 60,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "The brute force idea was simple.",
      "start_ms": 2580,
      "end_ms": 4600,
      "start_frame": 77,
      "end_frame": 138,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Generate every permutation, sort them, find the current one and take the next.",
      "start_ms": 5240,
      "end_ms": 11900,
      "start_frame": 157,
      "end_frame": 357,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "But factorial growth makes that approach impractical.",
      "start_ms": 12560,
      "end_ms": 16100,
      "start_frame": 377,
      "end_frame": 483,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimal solution uses the structure of the current permutation.",
      "start_ms": 16860,
      "end_ms": 21160,
      "start_frame": 506,
      "end_frame": 635,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "First, find the longest non -increasing suffix.",
      "start_ms": 21960,
      "end_ms": 25840,
      "start_frame": 659,
      "end_frame": 775,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Then find the pivot.",
      "start_ms": 26060,
      "end_ms": 27220,
      "start_frame": 782,
      "end_frame": 817,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "The rightmost position, where an increase is possible.",
      "start_ms": 27820,
      "end_ms": 31540,
      "start_frame": 835,
      "end_frame": 946,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, find the smallest value greater than the pivot and swap them.",
      "start_ms": 31860,
      "end_ms": 37440,
      "start_frame": 956,
      "end_frame": 1123,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Finally, reverse the suffix.",
      "start_ms": 37980,
      "end_ms": 41280,
      "start_frame": 1139,
      "end_frame": 1238,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "So everything after the pivot becomes as small as possible.",
      "start_ms": 41860,
      "end_ms": 45260,
      "start_frame": 1256,
      "end_frame": 1358,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "That gives us O of n time and O of one extra space.",
      "start_ms": 45700,
      "end_ms": 50520,
      "start_frame": 1371,
      "end_frame": 1516,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "But the bigger lesson is this.",
      "start_ms": 51040,
      "end_ms": 52860,
      "start_frame": 1531,
      "end_frame": 1586,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "When a problem asks for the next lexicographical arrangement, do not think about generating every possibility first.",
      "start_ms": 53500,
      "end_ms": 61220,
      "start_frame": 1605,
      "end_frame": 1837,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Look for the rightmost position, where a valid increase can be made.",
      "start_ms": 61540,
      "end_ms": 65680,
      "start_frame": 1846,
      "end_frame": 1970,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the smallest valid increase and minimize everything after it.",
      "start_ms": 66100,
      "end_ms": 71740,
      "start_frame": 1983,
      "end_frame": 2152,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "That reasoning is the real pattern.",
      "start_ms": 72160,
      "end_ms": 75240,
      "start_frame": 2165,
      "end_frame": 2257,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "And with that, next permutation is complete.",
      "start_ms": 75960,
      "end_ms": 80620,
      "start_frame": 2279,
      "end_frame": 2419,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Question 12.",
      "start_ms": 81440,
      "end_ms": 82540,
      "start_frame": 2443,
      "end_frame": 2476,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Done.",
      "start_ms": 83000,
      "end_ms": 83300,
      "start_frame": 2490,
      "end_frame": 2499,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "We continue our arrays and hashing roadmap.",
      "start_ms": 84120,
      "end_ms": 87320,
      "start_frame": 2524,
      "end_frame": 2620,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "With question 13.",
      "start_ms": 87820,
      "end_ms": 89600,
      "start_frame": 2635,
      "end_frame": 2688,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Set matrix zeros.",
      "start_ms": 90040,
      "end_ms": 91760,
      "start_frame": 2701,
      "end_frame": 2753,
      "word_count": 3
    }
  ],
